-- Robly Chess Bot for RoChess! (v7)
-- Engine: built-in negamax + quiescence.
-- Live games (online/bot): position from session.ucis, moves via App.onBoardMove
--   (game coordinates: 1-based a1-first => gameSq = mirrorW(engineIdx) + 1).
-- Other modes: board read from ChessUI piece ImageLabels (S1 = bottom-left).

